    "detailed_description": "<strong>Xenociders</strong> is a stealth action VR shooter set on a lush planet ruled by ferocious alien dinosaur predators.<br><br><strong>Hide. Hunt. Be hunted.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146920/extras/44eef8f255fe52b475fde2215d261aea.avif?t=1588857345\" /></div><br>You\u2019re the sole survivor of a shuttle crash on a deadly alien world. <br>Explore a series of wide regions and find a way to go back to orbit, to safety.<br><br>Observe your surroundings. <br>Stay low. <br>Sneak your way through the vegetation and avoid engaging the dinosaur-like predators.<br>And if it comes to you or them, your weapons pack a serious punch so fight it out till the end!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146920/extras/0083b719a819ec301bd3ab5bf1ad9b3d.avif?t=1588857345\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br>A vast alien jungle ruled by dinosaur-like deadly, vicious predators. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the lushest jungle ever seen in VR.</strong><br></li><li>Stay hidden! Stealth is key to survival. Know your surroundings, recon the area and plot a course that will keep you out of harm\u2019s way.<br></li><li>Not a wave shooter! Predators will employ challenging strategies to wear your group down.<br></li><li>Explore a beautiful, lush world in VR.<br></li><li>Weapons that pack a punch! From assault rifles to energy bows, weapons are deadly, precise and satisfying.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1146920/extras/175230d9341cc3544cbd948348a59a39.avif?t=1588857345\" /></div>",
